30. An NBFC not eligible to participate as JV partner, as above can make investments up to 10 percent of the owned fund of the NBFC or ₹50 crore, whichever is lower, in the insurance company, subject to the following conditions:
(1) The CRAR of the NBFC shall not be less than 15 percent;
(2) The level of net NPA shall be not more than five percent of total outstanding leased / hire purchase assets and advances;
